     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Hello,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">I’ve been using tRophicposition for about a year now and have had a great time with the package, first working through the Vingettes and then applying it to my own data. One question I have is whether individual\r\n estimates (estimates for individuals in the sample) can be obtained as output, or if only the posterior summaries for the whole sample is available?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Thank you for your help,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Bethany<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Bethany Bethke<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Fisheries Research Scientist | Fish and Wildlife<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Minnesota Department of Natural Resources<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">5351 N Shore Dr<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Duluth MN,  55805<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><a href=\"tel:(218)%20302-3271\" value=\"+12183023271\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">218-302-3271</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Bethany...@state.mn.us</a><u></u><u></u></spa